  "The extracted code has been copied to the clipboard. Click OK to go to the online disk link.": "提取码已复制到剪贴板，点击确定前往网盘链接",
  "One sentence is enough. \"Nothing comes to mind\" is a valid answer.": "一句话就够。答「想不出来」也是合格的答案。",
  "Four questions to answer, one by one. They are the exits the whole system drains into.": "四个要逐个回答的问题。整条流水线的出口都汇到这里。",
  "What is one new thing you did this week? Novel experiences land better when shared, so bring someone along if you can.": "这周做了一件什么新的事情？书里说新颖的体验在分享时效果更好，所以尽量带上一个人。",
  "One new thing this week": "本周一件新事物",
  "State record: did you log any this week? Do the triggers repeat an earlier one?": "状态管理表：这周记过吗？记下的触因，有没有和过去某次重复？",
  "Four lists: what is new this week that should be archived? Say which list, and why that one.": "四个 List：这周有哪一条新东西该归档？说清是哪一条 List、为什么是它。",
  "Three virtue tables: anything for the achievement list? Did the gratitude list actually land this week, or was it skimmed?": "三个优点表：这周有没有可以进「成就列表」的？这周的「感恩列表」有没有真切感受过，还是匆匆划过？",
  "Affirmation library: how many times did you actually use the phrases the monthly review produced?": "自我肯定库：月课产出的短语，这周实际用了几次？",
  "Do not reread the whole week. Just group this week's micro failures and count how often each kind showed up. Twice or more makes it a stumbling block.": "不要重读七天的失败。只做一件事：把这一周的微观失败归类，数哪一类出现了几次。出现两次以上，它才是绊脚石。",
  "No micro failure recorded this week": "这一周没有记录微观失败",
