  "Verdict": "判定",
  "Pick one from the candidates and write it into one of the three goals below. One at a time, until it becomes automatic.": "从候选池里挑一条，写进下面的某个目标里。一次改一个，改到它自动化为止。",
  "No candidate yet. Mark something as a stumbling block in 2.2 first.": "还没有候选。先在 2.2 里把某一条判成绊脚石。",
  "Turn it into a weekly goal": "把它变成本周目标",
  "One goal should be a realistic small step toward a macro direction. Each goal gets the SMART check.": "每周三个目标，其中一个应该是切实可行的小步骤，最终通向宏观方向。每个目标都过一遍 SMART。",
