  "Write down the reason, not the regret. The reason matters more than the miss.": "写原因，不是写悔意。原因比没做到本身更重要。",
  "The reason was the environment / other people, not me": "原因是环境 / 别人不配合，不是我",
  "Trigger": "触因",
  "A trigger is not random: it is the fingerprint of a similarity. Log a few and they will point at the same limiting belief. Once one reaches three, take it to the monthly review.": "触发诱因不是随机的，它是「相似感」的指纹。攒够几个，它们迟早指向同一个限制性观念。某一个到 3 次，就交给月课。",
