  "Delete trigger": "删除触因",
  "Quick logs of it are removed with it. State records you actually wrote keep their text and only lose the trigger link.": "随手的「记一次」会随它一起删掉；真正写过内容的状态记录会保留正文，只摘掉挂靠。",
  "These three directions are the anchor of the whole system. A weekly goal is a small step toward one of them, so the R in SMART has something to point at.": "这三个方向是全系统的锚。周目标是通向其中一个的小步骤，SMART 里那个 R 才有东西可对。",
  "No macro goal yet": "还没有宏观目标",
  "No domain": "未挂领域",
  "Delete macro goal": "删除宏观目标",
  "Direction": "方向",
  "Attaching a direction to a domain is optional.": "把方向挂到某个领域上是可选的。",
  "Triggers ready for the monthly review": "该交给月课的触因",
  "Finish this week's review": "完成本周周课（点完复盘主页就不再报逾期）",
  "Candidate pool": "候选池",
  "Marked by hand": "人工判定",
  "A book, a film, a conversation, something you realised on your own. Optional.": "可以来自书籍、电影、与朋友的交谈，或自己在自我发现之旅中的感悟。可留空。",
  "Accepting this kind of deep criticism is hard, so this step is not optional: give yourself a reward, make time for something you love that is only for you, and list the friends and family who make you feel good and plan to see them soon. This is the one step in the whole system that digs into sore spots - skip the care and you will not want to do the monthly review again.": "接受这种深刻的批评、并以开放的心态探究它们是很困难的。所以这一步是强制的：给自己一个应有的奖励，抽出时间做一些只为自己做的事，列出让你感觉良好的朋友和家人并计划不久后与之碰面。别跳过它——三列审视是全系统唯一一个专门挖痛处的动作，不做补偿，下个月就不想再做月课了。",
